meta {
  name: Get Chapter Image
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/image/:chap_id/:filename
  body: none
  auth: none
}

params:path {
  chap_id: one-piece.49::1
  filename: 001.jpg
}

assert {
  res.status: in [200, 404]
}

docs {
  # Get Chapter Image
  Extracts and serves an individual page image directly from the chapter's CBZ archive.

  ### Features
  - **In-Memory LRU Cache**: Frequently read pages are cached in memory for sub-millisecond retrieval.
  - **Read-Ahead Prefetching**: Automatically decompresses and caches the next 5 consecutive pages in the background for smooth reading experience in Mihon/Tachiyomi.
  - **Magic-Byte MIME Sniffing**: Returns accurate `Content-Type` headers (`image/jpeg`, `image/png`, `image/webp`).

  ### Path Parameters
  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  |-----------|------|----------|-------------|
  | `chap_id` | string | **Yes** | Compound chapter identifier (e.g. `one-piece.49::1`). |
  | `filename` | string | **Yes** | Filename inside the CBZ archive (e.g. `001.jpg`). |

  ### Responses
  - **`200 OK`**: Binary image stream with appropriate `Content-Type` header (`image/jpeg`, `image/png`, `image/webp`).
  - **`404 Not Found`**: Chapter archive or image file not found.
}
